---
---

<section id="contact" class="py-20 bg-slate-900 text-white border-t border-slate-800">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-950/60 via-slate-850 to-slate-900 border border-slate-800 p-8 sm:p-12 text-center max-w-4xl mx-auto shadow-2xl">
      <div class="h-12 w-12 rounded-2xl bg-indigo-500/20 text-indigo-400 border border-indigo-400/30 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-6 h-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"/></svg>
      </div>

      <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white mb-4">
        加入讨论与社区交流
      </h2>

      <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base max-w-xl mx-auto mb-8 leading-relaxed">
        Spark 项目已链接并认可 LINUX DO 社区。欢迎加入交流群组探讨 AI Coding Agent 的最佳实践、提交 Issue 与反馈建议。
      </p>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-4">
        <a
          href="https://linux.do/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noreferrer"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-500 font-semibold text-sm text-white shadow-lg shadow-indigo-600/30 transition-all active:scale-95"
        >
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20"/><path d="M2 12h20"/></svg>
          <span>访问 LINUX DO 社区</span>
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-indigo-200" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"/><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"/><line x1="10" y1="14" x2="21" y2="3"/></svg>
        </a>

        <a
          href="https://github.com/ngominhbinh708/spark"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noreferrer"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-750 border border-slate-700 font-semibold text-sm text-slate-200 transition-all hover:text-white"
        >
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M15 22v-4a4.8 4.8 0 0 0-1-3.5c3 0 6-2 6-5.5.08-1.25-.27-2.48-1-3.5.28-1.15.28-2.35 0-3.5 0 0-1 0-3 1.5-2.64-.5-5.36-.5-8 0C6 2 5 2 5 2c-.3 1.15-.3 2.35 0 3.5A5.403 5.403 0 0 0 4 9c0 3.5 3 5.5 6 5.5-.39.49-.68 1.05-.85 1.65-.17.6-.22 1.23-.15 1.85v4"/><path d="M9 18c-4.51 2-5-2-7-2"/></svg>
          <span>GitHub 仓库与反馈</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
